WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.002
-Now, John, I'm sure
you get asked this a lot,

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:06.573
but can you give us any spoilers
from "The Rise of Skywalker"?

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:09.175
-I'm in enough trouble so, no,
I'm going to keep my mouth shut.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.676
-Fair enough.
Fair enough.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:12.912
Maybe we could at least give
some spoilers of things

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.015
that definitely won't be
in "The Rise of Skywalker."

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.817
-I can do that.
-All right. It's time for

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.619
"Things You Won't Hear
in 'Star Wars.'"

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.787
♪♪

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:26.593
♪ Things you won't hear
in "Star Wars" ♪

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.930
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.266
-You won't hear Darth Vader say,

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.034 line:0%
"Luke, I'm your daddy."

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:39.472 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.841
-You won't hear
Obi-Wan Kenobi say,

00:00:42.841 --> 00:00:44.844 line:0%
"Dang it, I forgot to wear
Spanx under my robe today.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.279 line:0%
Hashtag Jedi fail!"

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:49.114 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Robot wails ]

00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:51.250
-You won't hear Yoda say,

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.654
"Just saw Dobby from
'Harry Potter' on Tinder. Mmm!

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.989 line:0%
Did I?
Right swipe, I will."

00:00:56.989 --> 00:01:00.726 line:0%
[ Robot beeps ]
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:02.395
-You won't hear Finn say,

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.530
"The only reason I switched
sides was because

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.132
I saw the 'Can you hear me now?'
guy switch

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.534 line:0%
from Verizon to Sprint, so --"

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.770 line:0%
[ Blip ]
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.807
-You won't hear
Luke Skywalker say,

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.275
"I have nipples, Greg.
Can you milk me?"

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:18.011
[ Laughter and cheering ]
[ Robot wails ]

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:20.813
[ Applause ]

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.583
-You won't hear C3PO say,
"Okay, boomer."

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:26.285
[ Laughter ]
[ Robot beeps ]

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:27.720
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.989
-You won't hear
Supreme Leader Snoke say,

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.658
"I just took a DNA test.

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.461 line:0%
Turns out I'm 100% that Sith."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:37.930 line:0%
[ Robot noises ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.133
-You won't hear Boba Fett say,

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.434
"I like hunting
for the Millennium Falcon,

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:46.238 line:0%
but I love hunting for
Black Friday deals at Kohl's."

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:47.640 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
[ Robot noises ]

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.642
[ Applause ]

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:53.479
-You won't hear Rey say,
"BB-8, you still need to --"

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:56.849 line:0%
Ven-- wait. That's some
American stuff. Venmo?

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:58.184 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.686 line:0%
Wait, let me take it again.
-Yeah.

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:03.189 line:0%
-You won't hear Rey say,
"BB-8, you still need to

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.125 line:0%
Venmo me for our Uber.
Your round, bitch."

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:09.529 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Robot beeps ]

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:12.765
-And finally, you won't hear
Kylo Ren say,

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:16.535 line:0%
"You think Baby Yoda is cute?
Well, check out Hot Yoda."

00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:18.037 line:0%
[ Robot wails ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.338
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:21.507
I can't wait to not hear
all those things

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:24.243
in "Star Wars:
The Rise of Skywalker."

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:25.845
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:28.614
My thanks to John Boyega!
[ Cheering ]

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:29.882
Stick around.
We'll be right back

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:32.051
with more of "The Tonight Show,"
everyone.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:35.255
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

